	(text "This NTC resistors is 10k at 25 degrees.\nAt 100 degrees, with B = 3380K, they are 1.024k. \nThe max temp which may be read safely is 150 degrees.\n\n150 degrees = 3V\n25 degrees = 0.82V\n\n"
